{"id":"luch","lemma":"луч","pos":"noun","rank":3271,"glosses":["ray, beam","radius bone"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"луча","plural":"лучи"},"examples":[{"text":"Человек не видит ультрафиолетовые лучи.","en":"Humans can't see ultraviolet light.","words":[{"g":"person"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},null,null]},{"text":"Снег отражает ультрафиолетовые лучи.","en":"Snow reflects ultraviolet light.","words":[{"g":"snow"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Ни один луч света не мог проникнуть в этот чулан.","en":"Not a ray of light could reach the closet.","words":[{"g":"not a"},{"g":"one"},null,{"g":"light","l":"свет"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to penetrate"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"pantry"}]},{"text":"Ультрафиолетовые лучи могут вызвать рак кожи.","en":"Ultraviolet rays can cause skin cancer.","words":[null,null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to call, to send for"},{"g":"crawfish, crayfish"},{"g":"skin","l":"кожа"}]},{"text":"Луна светит, потому что она отражает солнечные лучи.","en":"The moon shines because it reflects sunlight.","words":[{"g":"moon"},null,null,null,{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"sun","l":"солнечный"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"because"]]}]}